  "notes": [
    "PR-01 reference plaque repair preserved; no invented YMB/Yandex Marketing Bridge user-facing plaque reintroduced.",
    "PR-02 adds immediate toggle persistence for Debug, Auto Send, Wordstat Autorun policy, and report-prefix enabled state without committing unsaved text/credentials.",
    "PR-03 couples immediate Autorun policy persistence to Start availability so WS_AUTO_START reaches the existing backend lifecycle.",
    "PR-04 reports charged=false when estimated cost is zero, including getRegionsTree.",
    "PR-05 successful sent Wordstat responses explicitly carry request_executed=true and automatic_retry=false.",
    "PR-06 preserves already-executed Manual delivery state across pre-commit Send-target failure, adds a durable Manual commit boundary, and makes committed recovery reconciliation-only with no second Send/Yandex replay."
  ]
